<div class="prose-club">
  <p>This website has been designed to meet the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at level AA. That includes:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>clear headings and landmarks for screen reader users, plus a "skip to content" link</li>
    <li>full keyboard navigation, with visible focus indicators</li>
    <li>text alternatives for meaningful images</li>
    <li>colour contrast that meets AA guidelines</li>
    <li>respect for your "reduce motion" setting</li>
    <li>pages that work without JavaScript, with interactive tools added on top</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Some documents, such as competition results and policies, are provided as PDF or Word files. If you need information in a different format, please contact us.</p>
  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>If you have difficulty using any part of this site, please email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or call {{ site.phone }} and we'll do our best to help.</p>
</div>
